euthydemus-learn.logic.r2: argue/two-senses: O1 (S17): "unlearned" is taken as the dull, as opposed to the clever, are the ones who grasp what is taught in O1 and as the ignorant, who do not yet know a thing, are the ones who acquire knowledge of it where unlearned_learn is used else, a reader says: the argument does not turn on it
